[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4861.189, "timestamp": "01:21:01", "text": "CSVの代わりに「like any」を使ってもいいと思う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4865.27, "timestamp": "01:21:05", "text": "つまり、重要な価値ということですね"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4868.497, "timestamp": "01:21:08", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "stalker mindset"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4868.95, "timestamp": "01:21:08", "text": "？  CSVのフォーマットは、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4870.175, "timestamp": "01:21:10", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ToT"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4873.43, "timestamp": "01:21:13", "text": "ストーカーの思考回路に似ていると言えるでしょうか？ いいえ、それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4875.43, "timestamp": "01:21:15", "text": "モデレーター向けです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4878.55, "timestamp": "01:21:18", "text": "これはモデレーター向けです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4881.43, "timestamp": "01:21:21", "text": "例えば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4884.149, "timestamp": "01:21:24", "text": "YouTubeでライブ配信をしていると想像してみてください。 えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4887.35, "timestamp": "01:21:27", "text": "変な男があなたの配信にやってきて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4890.95, "timestamp": "01:21:30", "text": "何かを言って、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4893.27, "timestamp": "01:21:33", "text": "失礼なことを言ったんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4897.189, "timestamp": "01:21:37", "text": "スクリーンショットを撮ったり、何らかのアクションを起こしたり、後で彼をBANできるように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4900.39, "timestamp": "01:21:40", "text": "彼のユーザーIDやチャンネルIDを把握したりするのを忘れてしまいましたね"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4901.609, "timestamp": "01:21:41", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "feel spooky"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4902.39, "timestamp": "01:21:42", "text": "。 あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4905.83, "timestamp": "01:21:45", "text": "ゲームをしているんですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4909.11, "timestamp": "01:21:49", "text": "モデレーターはいないんですよね？ では、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4911.189, "timestamp": "01:21:51", "text": "あなたならどうしますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4913.59, "timestamp": "01:21:53", "text": "そして、その人は既にコメントを削除してしまったので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4916.87, "timestamp": "01:21:56", "text": "どこにも見つけることはできないでしょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4918.39, "timestamp": "01:21:58", "text": "？   そこで"}]